//= Eden Group Headquarter NPCs.
//===== Changelogs: ==========================================
//= 1.0 First Version. [L0ne_W0lf]
//= 1.1 Removed unencoded comments (Korean -> Gibberish)
//=     Readded the GM helper NPC, commented out.
